(1,'mainContent:4.stickyHeading1Intro','input','Ideal for quiet evenings'),
(1,'mainContent:4.stickyHeading1Para1','wysiwyg','<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1.1vw; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: Satoshi, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" class=\"regular-vw\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(21, 21, 21);\">Whether you&#039;re looking to reflect on your past, gain clarity on your goals, or simply find a few moments of calm in your busy day, this beautifully designed guide will inspire and motivate.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1.1vw; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: Satoshi, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" class=\"regular-vw\"></p><p></p><p></p>'),
(1,'mainContent:4.stickyHeading1Para2','wysiwyg','<p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239);\">Let Journey Within be the companion that helps you navigate life‚Äôs ups and downs with grace and mindfulness.</span></p>'),
(1,'mainContent:4.stickyHeading1Title','input','Mindful Living in Every Page'),
(1,'mainContent:4.stickyHeading2Intro','input','quality, simplicity, and comfort'),
(1,'mainContent:4.stickyHeading2Para1','wysiwyg','<p></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(21, 21, 21);\">Designed for those who appreciate the finer things in life, this mug combines functionality with sleek, modern design. Its smooth ceramic surface is easy to clean and resistant to stains, while the comfortable handle ensures a perfect grip every time.</span></p>'),
(1,'mainContent:4.stickyHeading2Para2','wysiwyg','<p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(21, 21, 21);\">Whether you&#039;re enjoying a quiet morning at home or a quick break at the office, the Morning Brew Mug adds a touch of sophistication to your daily routine.</span></p><p></p>'),
(1,'mainContent:4.stickyHeading2Title','input','Simplicity Meets Sophistication'),
