(12,'FAQ','Faq','Do you offer returns?','Yes! If you&#039;re not 100% satisfied with your purchase, we offer a 30-day return policy on all products.'),
(13,'FAQ','Faq','What‚Äôs the quality of your products?','We prioritize quality in every item we sell. Our products are designed to be durable, functional, and stylish.'),
(24,'FAQ','Faq','Do you ship internationally?','Absolutely. We offer worldwide shipping, so you can enjoy our products no matter where you are.'),
(25,'FAQ','Faq','How long will my order take to arrive?','Shipping times vary by location, but we aim to deliver within 5-10 business days for most orders.'),
(26,'FAQ','Faq','Are your products environmentally friendly?','We are committed to sustainability and use eco-friendly materials whenever possible in the production and packaging of our products.');
