(19,'Explorer Bag',44,'Whether you\'re commuting to work, taking a weekend getaway, or simply going about your daily routine, this bag is designed to meet your every need.',26,',43,46,36,','a:3:{i:0;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";i:1;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";i:2;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";}','Explorer Bag ensures that you\'re equipped to carry everything you need','White/Black',NULL),
(21,'Journey Within Book',49,'\"Journey Within\" will help you navigate life‚Äôs challenges with grace and intentionality. Let this book be your guide to living a more mindful and fulfilled life.',12,',43,46,36,','a:3:{i:0;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";i:1;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";i:2;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";}','\"Journey Within\" is more than just a book','White/Orange',NULL),
(23,'Morning Brew Mug',36,'With a 12-ounce capacity, the Morning Brew Mug is perfectly sized for your favorite beverages, from coffee and tea to hot chocolate or even a calming herbal infusion.',100,',43,46,36,','a:3:{i:0;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";i:1;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";i:2;s:63:\"a:3:{s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}s:4:\"crop\";a:0:{}}\";}','The Morning Brew Mug isn‚Äôt just your average mug','White/Orange',NULL);
